/E (Caravelli Italian Restaurant on Sparrow Hill is housed in The Old Manor, one of the oldest buildings in Loughborough. The recent discovery of a stone fireplace indicates it was originally built in the mid-fourteenth century. The building has a fine Swithland slate roof and a central gable facing the road through which the original front door would have run.)
